00:13:46.730 --> 00:13:48.559
with this group here

00:13:48.559 --> 00:13:49.620
who hasn't had the
opportunity to read it yet,

00:13:49.620 --> 00:13:51.451
most people probably.

00:13:51.451 --> 00:13:56.451
You talk a little bit
about this kind of like

00:13:57.147 --> 00:14:00.332
the botany of the friars you might say,

00:14:00.332 --> 00:14:05.332
and how it's discredited in
the global scientific community

00:14:06.070 --> 00:14:08.330
that's emerging around
the turn of the century,

00:14:08.330 --> 00:14:09.770
if I'm not mistaken.

00:14:09.770 --> 00:14:11.947
And it'd be useful if you
could explain some of that

00:14:11.947 --> 00:14:15.440
and how you also are
rethinking that a little bit.

00:14:15.440 --> 00:14:19.870
And then also you described
this emergent concept

00:14:19.870 --> 00:14:22.110
of I'm not sure how it's pronounced

