00:39:58.040 --> 00:40:00.350
- Measurement huh?

00:40:00.350 --> 00:40:01.910
Standards of measurement.

00:40:01.910 --> 00:40:03.860
That's a great question, right.

00:40:03.860 --> 00:40:06.770
And in Lunean botany there seems to be

00:40:07.840 --> 00:40:09.550
what becomes kind of a vocabulary

00:40:10.680 --> 00:40:12.316
a shared vocabulary of measurement, right?

00:40:12.316 --> 00:40:16.250
I mean, these texts are sharing
ways of describing plants

00:40:16.250 --> 00:40:18.880
by size for instance,
and they're able to maybe

00:40:19.727 --> 00:40:21.490
