00:40:21.490 --> 00:40:24.080
and this is something that's
getting shared across empires.

00:40:24.080 --> 00:40:26.770
And so this becomes a standard
way of understanding how

00:40:26.770 --> 00:40:28.220
we describe plants, right?

00:40:28.220 --> 00:40:29.900
There's this shared vocabulary,

00:40:29.900 --> 00:40:32.100
a shared style of measurement.

00:40:32.100 --> 00:40:33.620
What I think is really cool though

00:40:33.620 --> 00:40:36.162
